    "summary": "**ANATHEMA PSYKANA** units may join your army even if they lack **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** as a Faction keyword. Two limits apply as you [Muster Armies](vsdata:core-rule/muster-armies), unless another rule says otherwise: **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** can never be picked as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), and no **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** model can be your **WARLORD**.",
